---
import RootLayout from "~/layouts/RootLayout.astro";

const metadata = {
  title: "Stream Amapiano, Gqom & Afrobeats — DeeMusiq",
  description:
    "DeeMusiq is the Africa-first music streaming app for amapiano, gqom, afrobeats, maskandi, hip hop and more — built for South African listeners and artists.",
  keywords:
    "amapiano streaming, gqom music app, afrobeats streaming, South African music app, stream SA music, maskandi, DeeMusiq",
};
---

<RootLayout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="p-4 md:p-16 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="h1">Stream Amapiano, Gqom and Afrobeats</h1>
    <br />
    <p class="text-surface-500">
      It's a drop day. DeeMusiq is an Africa-first music streaming app built
      for the sounds that move the continent — amapiano, gqom, afrobeats,
      maskandi, SA hip hop, house and everything in between.
    </p>
    <br /><br />

    <h2 class="h2">Made for South African ears</h2>
    <br />
    <p>
      Global streaming platforms treat African genres as an afterthought —
      buried playlists, slow local payouts, and catalogs that lag behind the
      streets. DeeMusiq flips that around. South African music is the main
      event here, not a niche category. Discover new amapiano drops, deep-cut
      gqom, and the latest afrobeats alongside the international catalog you
      already love.
    </p>
    <br />

    <h3 class="h3">One app, every platform</h3>
    <br />
    <p>
      DeeMusiq runs natively on Android, Windows, macOS, Linux and iOS — no
      Electron, no bloated web wrapper. That means smooth playback and offline
      listening even on older devices and tighter data budgets. Grab it from
      the <a href="/downloads" class="underline">downloads page</a> or
      straight from
      <a href="https://deemusiq.co.za/downloads/android" target="_blank" class="underline">deemusiq.co.za</a>.
    </p>
    <br />

    <h3 class="h3">Streaming that pays the artists</h3>
    <br />
    <p>
      Every stream on DeeMusiq supports the people who made the music. Our
      built-in token wallet routes value back to South African artists
      directly — read
      <a href="/artist-payouts" class="underline">how artist payouts work</a>
      to see why streaming amapiano on DeeMusiq puts more in the artist's
      pocket.
    </p>
    <br />

    <h3 class="h3">Open-source roots</h3>
    <br />
    <p>
      DeeMusiq is built on the beloved open-source Spotube project. Learn what
      we kept, what we added, and why it matters on our
      <a href="/spotube-alternative" class="underline">Spotube alternative</a>
      page.
    </p>
    <br /><br />

    <a href="/downloads" class="btn preset-filled-primary-300-700">
      Download DeeMusiq
    </a>
  </section>
</RootLayout>
